$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=cbelin  LOC_AFTER=?

* A quantity below 1 + P M is below exp ( P M ) : the route used for the linear summand T + 2 of step 3 of the cost budget (Lean AlgBudget.lean, ` hT2E ` , from Real.add_one_le_exp).

h1::cbelin.1 |- ( ph -> M e. RR )
h2::cbelin.2 |- ( ph -> 0 < M )
h3::cbelin.3 |- ( ph -> P e. RR )
